plaso.tsv: what plaso (the log2timeline/plaso:20260720 Docker image) reads
from the logs in tests/fixtures/plaso/ with its mcafee_protection,
symantec_scanlog, text/sophos_av, trendmicro_vd and trendmicro_url parsers
(psort -o json_line), one line per event: the file, the time (microseconds
since 1970, local times as if UTC), then the values compared (see
tests/plaso.rs). Written from plaso's output, not from this crate.
